 "remarks": "Exceptionally bright, spacious and thoughtfully updated, this 1-bedroom, 1.5-bath condo offers approximately 1,080 square ft of comfortable living with beautiful city views. The open layout with h/w floors features a generously sized living and dining area that flows seamlessly to a private balcony-perfect for relaxing or enjoying the skyline.  The updated kitchen is designed for both style and functionality, featuring a gas range, new quartz countertops. Dining area has a rare walk-in pantry that provides exceptional storage. The oversized primary suite includes custom closets and an en-suite bathroom with a luxurious jacuzzi tub, creating a private retreat.  Additional highlights include walk-in-closet in the foyer, newer windows, and a convenient half bath for guests. The well-maintained, secure building offers two elevators, laundry on every floor, and assigned parking for added convenience.  Enjoy comfortable city living with space, updates, and amenities rarely found at this size.",
